Let's check the condition again. "placing mochi A on top of mochi B". This implies an order. So we are looking for pairs $(i, j)$ where $i$ is the index of the top mochi and $j$ is the index of the bottom mochi.
The condition is $A_i \le \frac{A_j}{2}$.
Since $A_i$ and $A_j$ are sizes, and we are choosing two distinct mochi, $i \neq j$.
